# Production build — committed, no secrets.
#
# Loaded by `npm run build`. These values are compiled into the bundle and are
# readable by anyone who opens the page, so nothing here can be a credential.
#
# This address used to be a hardcoded fallback inside src/api.ts, which meant a
# build with the variable missing silently pointed at production instead of
# failing. It is a deployment decision, so it lives here where it can be
# changed without touching code — and where a hosting platform's own
# environment variable can override it.

# Base URL of the deployed Helio API.
#
# Whatever is set here must appear in the API's CORS_ORIGIN list as the origin
# serving this bundle, or every request fails in the browser.
VITE_API_URL=https://u14kij0jkg.execute-api.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com
